								<section class='case-tab-panel' id='panel-rejected'>
										<div class='case-tab-context'><div class='case-tab-title'><i class='zc-li-outline ui-1-simple-remove'></i><span>Rejected matters</span></div><div class='case-tab-hint'>Rejected intakes and conflicts are shown for audit and reference.</div></div>
